                                        </small>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <div class="alert mb-0 py-2" style="background: #d1f2eb; border: 1px solid #7dd3c0; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.75rem 1rem;">
                                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
